    direct-MLE GMM (EM+BIC)             : 0.0166   (mean k=2.0)
  pdf accuracy vs TRUTH (MSE, lower=better):
    BEST-window Parzen pdf              : 0.00010
    MLP-on-Parzen pdf (derivative)      : 0.00112
    direct-MLE GMM pdf                  : 0.00005
  the net vs its OWN target (KS, ~0 => faithful copy, no statistical value added):
    net-CDF vs its Silverman-Parzen target : 0.0242

